        "texto_completo": "Iván Martín Aránguez: Positions, Relations and Network - MarketScreener Iván Martín Aránguez Founder at Magallanes Value Investors SA SGIIC 49 year 10 connections Finance Consumer Services Profile Mr. Iván Martín Aránguez , CFA, is a Chairman, CIO & Founder at Magallanes Value Investors SA SGIIC. He has over 15 years of professional experience. Before cofounding Magallanes he worked at Santander Asset Management SA SGIIC as Head of Iberian Equities, at Aviva Gestión as Head of Equities and at Sabadell Gestión where he delivered superior returns in Spanish and European Equities until mid-2014. Mr. Aránguez holds a Bachelors degree in Business Administration and a Masters degree in Financial Analysis from Universidad Carlos III de Madrid. Iván Martín Aránguez active positions Companies Position Start Magallanes Value Investors SA SGIIC Magallanes Value Investors SA SGIIC Investment Managers Finance Magallanes aims to preserve and increase their clients’ capital by over performing the market in the long-term. The firm follows a value investing philosophy and always looks for the highest ESG standards in their companies. They buy companies when there is a significant difference between price and fundamental value. Founder 2014-11-25 All active positions of Iván Martín Aránguez Former positions of Iván Martín Aránguez Companies Position End Santander Asset Management SA SGIIC Santander Asset Management SA SGIIC Investment Managers Finance Santander AM is an active, fundamental, value-oriented manager which invests in global debt and equity across sectors and market-caps. The firm aims to purchase assets which are undervalued but without negative momentum. They combine a bottom-up approach to fundamental analysis with a rigorous risk management process, in order to achieve an active return (alpha) in their investment portfolios. Head-Equity Investments - Santa Lucía Gestión SGIIC SA (Old) Santa Lucía Gestión SGIIC SA (Old) Investment Managers Fi